# ── Frontend environment ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the ASP.NET Core API (backend/Nexus.Api).
# Leave unset / commented to run the board in offline MOCK mode with the
# built-in demo data — every action already goes through src/services/api.ts
# so flipping this variable is the only change needed to go live.

VITE_API_URL=https://localhost:7001
